Modifications made in this fork, summarised (full list in git history):

  - Security hardening: brute-force protection on channel and LAN pairing PINs,
    credential masking in the LAN control server, path-traversal fix in file
    serving, MCP tool-description sanitisation, Telegram authorisation by user
    id rather than chat id, and a high-impact-tool gate for remote sources.
    Audit reports: docs/SECURITY_AUDIT.md and docs/SECURITY_AUDIT_R2.md.
    Real-device end-to-end verification for these is NOT complete; see
    QA_CHECKLIST.md sections SEC1-SEC11.
  - Localisation: complete English / Simplified Chinese / Japanese interface.
  - Additional remote-control channels (WeChat, QQ, Douyin) and restored
    access to a channel settings group that was unreachable upstream.
  - Continuous integration: Android emulator matrix, and unit tests wired into
    the build workflow.
  - Distribution: independent signing key, and issue/update links retargeted
    from the upstream repository to this one.

